Scope note (not part of the MIT terms above)

The MIT licence above covers the source code and the 3D models authored for
this project (`src/assets/models/**`). It does NOT cover:

  - `src/assets/audio/music/**` — composed by Aleksandr Manin, all rights
    reserved, used here with permission. Not licensed for reuse.
  - `src/assets/audio/sounds/footstep*` — third-party SFX (Stormwave Audio);
    see the ID3 tags on those files for attribution.
  - `public/fonts/bebas-neue-*` — Bebas Neue, SIL Open Font License 1.1.

If you reuse the code or the models, keep the copyright notice and this
licence with them — that is the one thing MIT asks.
